  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMS-Living for a better story</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project draws on the experiences from a previous project in Cairo, and aims at empowering vulnerable women and men in five cities across the upper Nile area in Egypt. The objective is to see them enabled to face the impact of violence that they are subjected to and empowering them to change their beliefs and views towards themselves and their lives.</narrative>
  </description>
